@startuml
!include ../../rixte/shortfall/style.iuml
title Executing delete-recipe 2: confirm and delete

actor User
participant ":MishMash" as App
participant "cmd:DeleteRecipeCommand" as Cmd
participant "recipeBook:RecipeBook" as Book

note over App, Cmd : Parsing has already created cmd for index 2.

App -> Cmd : confirmationPrompt(recipeBook)
activate Cmd

Cmd -> Cmd : findTarget(recipeBook)
activate Cmd
Cmd -> Book : size()
activate Book
Book --> Cmd : recipeCount
deactivate Book
Cmd -> Book : getRecipes()
activate Book
Book --> Cmd : recipes
deactivate Book
Cmd --> Cmd : target
deactivate Cmd

Cmd --> App : question
deactivate Cmd

App -> User : display question
User --> App : "y"

App -> Cmd : executeWithResult(recipeBook)
activate Cmd

Cmd -> Cmd : execute(recipeBook)
activate Cmd

Cmd -> Cmd : findTarget(recipeBook)
activate Cmd
note right of Cmd : Repeats the checks above
Cmd --> Cmd : target
deactivate Cmd

Cmd -> Book : remove(1)
activate Book
Book --> Cmd : deleted
deactivate Book
Cmd -> Book : size()
activate Book
Book --> Cmd : recipesRemaining
deactivate Book
Cmd --> Cmd : confirmation
deactivate Cmd

Cmd --> App : result
deactivate Cmd
App -> User : display confirmation

Cmd -[hidden]-> App
destroy Cmd

note over Cmd, Book
  An index that is out of range makes findTarget fail
  before the question, so nothing is asked or removed.
  result is a CommandResult holding the confirmation text with status done.
end note
@enduml
